   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Worth considering next\n\n• VPC endpoints (S3, ECR, Secrets Manager, CloudWatch)\n  keep AWS API traffic off the NAT → cheaper, private\n• \"Completely separate teams\" → one AWS account + VPC per\n  team, linked by PrivateLink / Transit Gateway, is the\n  stronger isolation boundary than subnets in one VPC\n• Order → payment over internal ALB or service discovery\n  (Cloud Map), not hard-coded task IPs",
   "originalText": "Worth considering next\n\n• VPC endpoints (S3, ECR, Secrets Manager, CloudWatch)\n  keep AWS API traffic off the NAT → cheaper, private\n• \"Completely separate teams\" → one AWS account + VPC per\n  team, linked by PrivateLink / Transit Gateway, is the\n  stronger isolation boundary than subnets in one VPC\n• Order → payment over internal ALB or service discovery\n  (Cloud Map), not hard-coded task IPs",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rv_next",
